WEBVTT

00:09:00.625 --> 00:09:02.833
And unfortunately,

00:09:04.875 --> 00:09:07.309
partly as a result of this anger,

00:09:07.333 --> 00:09:12.101
the West didn't notice
the significance of another event

00:09:12.125 --> 00:09:15.458
that happened also in 2001.

00:09:16.375 --> 00:09:20.083
China joined the World Trade Organization.

00:09:21.250 --> 00:09:24.226
Now, when you suddenly inject

00:09:24.250 --> 00:09:28.476
900 million new workers

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:32.101
into the global capitalist system,